error[SC0411]: `q` is read before anything was assigned to it
   ╭─[ a_local_whose_address_is_taken_read_by_name_before_anything_wrote_it_is_reported.c:4:12 ]
   │
 4 │     return q == 0;
   │            ───┬──  
   │               ╰──── read here
───╯
  = note: C17 6.2.4 p6 and 6.7.9 p10 leave a local indeterminate until something writes it, and Annex J.2 lists using that value as undefined
  = note: this check belongs to safety level 1
  = help: assign it where it is declared, `= 0` if nothing else
